# Secrets — the deployment-root token and every per-child secret file. Only the
# `.env.example` templates are tracked; the real `.env` files never are.
.env
*/.env

# In a real workspace each child dir is a materialized checkout the operator
# places (clone / submodule / worktree). Here the children are committed
# placeholders illustrating the layout, so nothing is ignored under them beyond
# their `.env`.
